          <metadata>
            <title>WN25-MS-000060 - Windows Server 2025 must restrict remote calls to the Security Account Manager (SAM) to Administrators on domain-joined member servers and stand-alone or nondomain-joined systems.</title>
            <affected family="windows">
              <platform>Microsoft Windows Server 2025</platform>
            </affected>
            <description>The Windows SAM stores users' passwords. Restricting Remote Procedure Call (RPC) connections to the SAM to Administrators helps protect those credentials.</description>
